WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:09,490
Jiaojiao, please save Jiaojiao

2
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:10,890
Countless times

3
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:13,490
I didn’t expect that little country bumpkin’s dog could swim.

4
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:19,720
Contact your family doctor quickly

5
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:21,720
Let him come quickly and show Jiaojiao

6
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:36,220
That's enough. Stop making excuses.

7
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:38,420
Do you still want to say that Jiaojiao pushed you?

8
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:39,820
You are only three and a half years old

9
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:41,820
Why did you get into the habit of lying?

10
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:48,140
Are you two suffering from Alzheimer's disease?

11
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:50,140
I can't even see such a simple frame-up.

12
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:56,060
What's the dog's name?

13
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:57,340
Put him in a cage

14
00:00:57,340 --> 00:01:01,680
This is not my home

15
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:05,500
I want to take little Huihui home

16
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:06,580
Just a beast

17
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:07,580
It's just sword leather

18
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,580
Give it a beating and be honest, stop it

19
00:01:09,580 --> 00:01:11,800
Are you all blind?

20
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:17,460
I didn’t see Yoyo coming over while still in the water.
